  m_Name: Carta_VLTMetroLeve
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "VLT / Metr\xF4 Leve"
  _titleEn: Light Rail
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "O ve\xEDculo leve sobre trilhos leva muita gente com conforto, sem emitir
    polui\xE7\xE3o na rua, e ajuda a requalificar o centro por onde passa."
  _summaryEn: Light rail carries many people comfortably, with no street-level emissions,
    and helps regenerate the downtown areas it runs through.
  _realWorld: "O VLT Carioca come\xE7ou a operar em 2016 no centro do Rio de Janeiro,
    ligando a rodovi\xE1ria, o aeroporto Santos Dumont e a zona portu\xE1ria."
  _realWorldEn: Rio de Janeiro's light rail began running in 2016 downtown, linking
    the bus station, Santos Dumont airport and the port area.
  _tradeOffs: "A obra \xE9 cara e longa, e a opera\xE7\xE3o depende de subs\xEDdio
    e de integra\xE7\xE3o com \xF4nibus."
  _tradeOffsEn: Construction is expensive and long, and operation depends on subsidies
    and integration with buses.
  _sources:
  - Label: "VLT Carioca (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/VLT_Carioca
